  unitName: Divine Revolvers Millie
  unitId: 20217
  unitNumber: 1780
  description: The wielder of the divine twin guns known as "Rickel" is said to have
    given up her own name to the guns in exchange for amazing abilities. Had she
    been able to continue fighting in Grand Gaia and learned to fully control the
    divine twin guns, she would have earned back her real name. Her story hence be
    quite different, as Rickel would have then granted its wielder all of its great
    power upon having found her worthy.
  summonDesc: I finally got my name back.<br>That can only mean that Rickel and I<br>have
    grown even closer!
  fusionDesc: You ask me what has changed?<br>Well, nothing!<br>Rickel and I are
    still one and the same.
  evoDesc: Finally, my name's been acknowledged!<br>I'm Millie, Rickel's actually
    my partner.
  element: 2
  rarity: 7
